{"root":{"data":{"id":"dml8ppmndqo0","created":1793674978493,"text":"4 GPS 卫星信号和导航电文"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dml92yrdfeo0","created":1793676017104,"text":"GPS卫星信号","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlc5ane1wo0","created":1793684663042,"text":"GPS卫星信号是调制波"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlc5kgq4qo0","created":1793684684407,"text":"载波","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm6y34u0mo0","created":1793771552541,"text":"GPS使用L波段的两种载频"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm6x8zau7c0","created":1793771486903,"text":"时钟基准频率为：f0 = 10.23 MHz"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm6yc6r14w0","created":1793771572248,"text":"L1 载波","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm6yl6cqqw0","created":1793771591815,"text":"fL1 = 154 * f0 = 1575.42 MHz，波长 λ1 = 19.032 cm"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm89shsvfs0","created":1793775290860,"text":"L1C/A      传统信号，目前仍广泛使用，保证了向后兼容性"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm8abfc2bk0","created":1793775332070,"text":"L1C         最新的民用信号，设计用于与其他GNSS（如Galileo）互操作，是L1 C/A的现代化替代"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm6yf38x340","created":1793771578566,"text":"L2C 载波"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm6yl6cqqw0","created":1793771591815,"text":"fL2 = 120 * f0 = 1227.6 MHz，波长 λ2 = 24.42 cm"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm89yp6hko0","created":1793775304367,"text":"第二个民用信号，专为商业需求设计，与L1组合可实现双频电离层校正，提升精度"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm7ht205200","created":1793773097885,"text":"L5 载波"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm6yl6cqqw0","created":1793771591815,"text":"fL5 = 115 * f0 = 1176.45 MHz，波长 λ5 = 25.48 cm"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm8a6qntk80","created":1793775321871,"text":"第三个民用信号，专为生命安全等高要求应用设计，功率更高、带宽更大，抗干扰和多径能力更强"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm766xxd9c0","created":1793772187744,"text":"选择两个载频的目的是消除由于电离层效应而引起的延迟误差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlc5m7yuxk0","created":1793684688231,"text":"测距码(粗C/A码)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm8jzkvvjk0","created":1793776089926,"text":"是一种伪随机码，PRN"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlc5oyhdls0","created":1793684694188,"text":"数据码"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dml932899eg0","created":1793676024655,"text":"GPS卫星的导航电文"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dml93fhfsog0","created":1793676053508,"text":"GPS卫星位置的计算"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dml93qifoeg0","created":1793676077513,"text":"BDS导航电文与卫星坐标计算"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dml942i5bmw0","created":1793676103617,"text":"GPS接收机基本工作原理"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue-compat","version":"1.4.43"}